id: pm-review-evidence-envelopes
title: Import provider-neutral review evidence envelopes
description: "Import explicit code or document review artifacts through a common typed envelope with bounded inputs, immutable source identity and honest provenance."
type: Feature
pm_format_version: 2
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-23T16:45:35.791Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-23T17:48:34.813Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Local-file and synthetic HTTP imports deduplicate and preserve source revisions; Unsupported provenance cannot establish review completion; Typed SDK and CLI return compact TOON or JSON with remedies; Read-only public fleet tracker validation works without git; CI release gates pass with unchanged npm and Bun thresholds; Envelope findings receive local verdicts through the public CLI and SDK without GitHub coordinates
parent: pm-review-epic
comments[10]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T16:45:55.154Z",codex-agent,"Overlap rechecked against current CLI 2026.10.23 and sibling packages: core structured notes provide storage and attribution without review lifecycle; pm-observer captures explicit agent-event exports and summaries, not ReviewFinding provenance or review completion. Existing pm-review import remains the GitHub live adapter. Plan: typed explicit artifact envelope, canonical provider/origin/artifact/revision/finding identity, digest-pinned file and HTTP input, immutable replay and typed refusals. Declared artifact provenance never establishes completion. Use SDK schema, certified complete reads, native create locks/history, and host output; no git on ingestion paths. Pinned SDK retained as requested."
  "2026-10-23T16:53:38.830Z",codex-agent,"Initial targeted suite: 8/8 passed, including real host TOON/JSON with PATH containing no git, pinned local and synthetic HTTP replay, revision preservation, completion/coverage refusal and concurrent SDK creates. Local typecheck and lint passed; duplication remains 0%; 114 declarations documented. Read-only public validation: 51 items, 22 ReviewFinding rows, 17 with known revisions imported once and replayed over synthetic HTTP (17 reused); 5 missing-revision rows held; 2 revisions preserved; 108 durable public-source files unchanged; largest JSON receipt 254 bytes; zero completion claims. Added packed npm/Bun ingest assertions for CI and checking governance/error paths before final gates."
  "2026-10-23T16:57:58.598Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof completed in an isolated source copy: removed only source.revision from importEvidenceEnvelope identity scope, then ran node --test --test-name-pattern=\"envelopes deduplicate immutable revisions\" test/envelopes.test.ts. The named test failed its new-revision assertion (created undefined instead of 2; 0 pass, 1 fail). Original implementation passes. No export or test was removed. Source artifact ids and declared reviewer/origin/subject are retained; per-observation immutable hashes support subset imports, native concurrent creates and preservation of existing local decisions. Unrelated SDK governance failures retain their original typed error."
  "2026-10-23T17:02:08.267Z",codex-agent,"PR opened ready for review: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/pull/38. Real-data validation rerun against the current importer with read-only durable source files: same 51/22/17/17/5/2/108 counts and 254-byte maximum receipt. The pm-linked targeted run reached its default 120-second limit on the saturated host; retained that receipt and raised only this linked test timeout to 1200 seconds. No release or coverage threshold changed; CI provides the full npm/Bun gate evidence."
  "2026-10-23T17:06:01.476Z",codex-agent,"CI run 39991602774 executed 221/221 behavioral tests successfully on Node 22 and Node 26, then refused coverage because the new erased envelope-types.ts module was imported only as types and therefore appeared unloaded. All three runtime envelope modules measured 100/100/100/100. Added the same explicit erased-module load used by the existing coverage inventory contract; no source omission, ignore list, threshold or gate change. Targeted local suite passed 10/10, and the type-only module now measures 100% after loading. Re-running the unchanged full CI gates."
  "2026-10-23T17:14:37.349Z",codex-agent,"Verified code candidate 235148e: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/actions/runs/39992563740 passed both jobs. npm Node 22, npm Node 26 and Bun release gates each passed 221/221 behavioral tests and 1/1 packed npm/Bun acceptance; all 34 authored source files measured 100/100/100/100, 114 declarations documented, duplication 0%. Local pm test pm-review-evidence-envelopes --run --progress passed node --test test/envelopes.test.ts (10/10; exit 0; 1200-second linked budget). npm run typecheck, npm run build:test, npm run lint, npm run docstring, npm run duplication and npm run changelog:check passed. Installed CLI 2026.10.23 structured notes still lack review lifecycle; pm-observer remains agent-event capture. Host-global pm-github skew clears with isolated HOME and fresh CI health passes. No upstream CLI/SDK defect reproduced. Real-data results and revert proof are in docs/evidence-envelopes-validation.md. Remaining boundary: source provenance is declared; remote backends are not separately certified. Work ready for orchestrator verification; leave item unclosed."
  "2026-10-23T17:29:17.817Z",codex-agent,"Reopened implementation work for the blocking public-verdict review finding on PR 38. Branch pulled from origin; main has not advanced from the original base. Envelope imports currently omit GitHub coordinates but public review verdict requires them, and the replay test bypasses that public path. Fix plan: select envelope observations by their stable namespaced envelope identity, permit coordinate-free local decisions through the public command and exported SDK, reject remote application and GitHub selectors on that path, and replace the helper shortcut with public command coverage. Add a real no-git CLI regression and behavioral revert proof; retain GitHub ownership checks."
  "2026-10-23T17:37:14.798Z",codex-agent,"Fixed the blocking verdict finding: public review verdict selects envelope observations by the imported item id and persisted envelope namespace, with no repo/PR coordinates. Exported decide supports the same local path and exposes VerdictInput/VerdictReceipt/VerdictTransport. Envelope --apply and GitHub selectors refuse with envelope_verdict_local_only and a remedy before any credentials load; GitHub findings still require matching repo/PR ownership. GitHub transport creation is deferred until a validated remote application. Replaced recordVerdict helper use in the preservation test with the registered public command. Real no-git CLI regression imports, decides, refuses remote application, uses public SDK, and verifies decisions survive replay. Packed npm/Bun acceptance now records a public envelope verdict."
  "2026-10-23T17:37:18.382Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: copied sources to an isolated scratch workspace, restored only the mandatory targetOf(ctx.options) call in dispatchReviewCommand verdict handling, rebuilt with tsc, then ran node --test --test-name-pattern=\"public envelope verdict CLI\" test/envelopes.test.ts. The named public CLI regression failed at the verdict exit assertion (2 instead of 0; 0 pass, 1 fail); import and module loading succeeded. Fixed code passed node --test --test-name-pattern=\"envelopes deduplicate|public envelope verdict\" test/envelopes.test.ts through pm test --only-last --run --progress (3/3). GitHub compatibility and SDK guard selection passed 3/3; the final consolidated SDK guard cases passed 1/1. npm run typecheck, npm run build:test, npm run lint and npm run docstring passed (115 declarations); duplication remains 0%. No original import/public-corpus work was repeated. Final exact-head npm/Bun gate evidence will be published in the linked PR once complete."
  "2026-10-23T17:48:31.741Z",codex-agent,"CI 39996625199 at code commit 82f0c24 passed 222/222 behavioral tests and unchanged full coverage on both Node versions. Node 26 also passed packed acceptance and the entire Bun release gate. Node 22 packed acceptance had already passed the envelope public-verdict assertions, then failed in unchanged native Bun closeout preparation (workspace-copy/ENOENT). Failure is retained at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/actions/runs/39996625199/job/120561709283. Started one failed-job rerun on the same code for diagnosis. Separate copy stability follow-up pm-review-bun-closeout-copy records the unconfirmed cause; no closeout implementation or gate policy changed. Final PR evidence will distinguish the original failed attempt and the final verified gate."
